#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1980
msgid "The major AI crawlers are allowed in robots.txt."
msgstr "Главни ВИ краулери су дозвољени у robots.txt."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2872
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2880
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4456
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4614
